source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Builds or runs a game: Rust gameplay, leptoskit menus, a wgpu picture

Usage: leptoskit game [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  build  Builds the game crate
  run    Runs the game and writes the last frame
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
